  padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm'>
  <p align=center style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-align:center'><span
  style='sans-serif'><a name="tvpllink_dtlscotrac"><span style='color:black'>QCVN
  04:2021/BCA</span></span></a></p>
