  style='sans-serif'><span style='color:black'>8424.10.90</span></span></p>
  </td>
  <td width="13%" style='width:13.78%;border-top:none;border-left:none;
  border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
  padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm'>
